{"seq":2,"slug":"server-actions-mutations","title":"Server Actions 与数据变更","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/react-server-components/server-actions-mutations","wordCount":1199,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"server-actions-与数据变更\">Server Actions 与数据变更</h1><p>RSC 架构解决了&quot;服务端到客户端&quot;的数据流问题——Server Components 直接获取数据、流式传输结果。但应用不只有读操作。用户提交表单、点击&quot;加入购物车&quot;、删除评论——这些<strong>变更操作</strong>需要一条从客户端回到服务端的通道。Server Actions 就是 React 为 RSC 架构设计的反向数据流原语：标记为 <code>&#39;use server&#39;</code> 的异步函数可以从 Client Component 中像调用本地函数一样调用，底层由框架处理 RPC 通信、序列化、重验证和渐进增强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Server Actions 是为 RSC 架构设计的<strong>反向数据流原语</strong>：标记 <code>&#39;use server&#39;</code> 的异步函数可从 Client Component 像本地函数一样调用，框架负责 RPC 通信、参数序列化、自动重验证和渐进增强。它有两种声明方式（文件级 <code>&#39;use server&#39;</code> 与组件内联并捕获闭包），配合 <code>useActionState</code> / <code>useOptimistic</code> 管理提交状态与乐观更新。其安全模型建立在编译时加密 ID、死代码消除、输入验证、CSRF 防护与闭包绑定之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"server-actions-的执行模型\">Server Actions 的执行模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant C as Client Component&#10;    participant F as Framework (Next.js)&#10;    participant SA as Server Action&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;C: 点击提交按钮&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;F: 调用 action 函数引用&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;F: 序列化参数为 FormData/JSON&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;SA: POST /_rsc/action (加密端点)&#10;    SA-&gt;&gt;DB: 执行变更&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;SA: 变更结果&#10;    SA-&gt;&gt;SA: revalidatePath / revalidateTag&#10;    SA--&gt;&gt;F: 返回结果 + 触发重验证&#10;    F-&gt;&gt;F: 重新获取受影响的 Server Components&#10;    F--&gt;&gt;C: 更新 RSC Payload (流式)&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;U: UI 自动更新\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant C as Client Component\n    participant F as Framework (Next.js)\n    participant SA as Server Action\n    participant DB as 数据库\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;C: 点击提交按钮\n    C-&gt;&gt;F: 调用 action 函数引用\n    F-&gt;&gt;F: 序列化参数为 FormData/JSON\n    F-&gt;&gt;SA: POST /_rsc/action (加密端点)\n    SA-&gt;&gt;DB: 执行变更\n    DB--&gt;&gt;SA: 变更结果\n    SA-&gt;&gt;SA: revalidatePath / revalidateTag\n    SA--&gt;&gt;F: 返回结果 + 触发重验证\n    F-&gt;&gt;F: 重新获取受影响的 Server Components\n    F--&gt;&gt;C: 更新 RSC Payload (流式)\n    C--&gt;&gt;U: UI 自动更新</pre><p>Server Actions 的核心语义：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>声明</strong>：在函数体或文件顶部写 <code>&#39;use server&#39;</code></li>\n<li><strong>引用传递</strong>：框架编译时将函数替换为一个 Server Reference（加密 ID），传给客户端</li>\n<li><strong>RPC 执行</strong>：客户端调用时，框架发送 POST 请求到专属端点，携带序列化的参数</li>\n<li><strong>自动重验证</strong>：Action 完成后，相关路由/数据标签被标记为 stale，触发 RSC 重渲染</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"两种声明方式\">两种声明方式</h2><p><strong>文件级声明</strong>——整个文件的所有导出函数都是 Server Actions：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/actions.ts&#10;&#39;use server&#39;;&#10;&#10;import { db } from &#39;@/lib/db&#39;;&#10;import { revalidatePath } from &#39;next/cache&#39;;&#10;&#10;export async function createPost(formData: FormData) {&#10;  const title = formData.get(&#39;title&#39;) as string;&#10;  const content = formData.get(&#39;content&#39;) as string;&#10;&#10;  await db.post.create({ data: { title, content } });&#10;  revalidatePath(&#39;/posts&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;export async function deletePost(id: string) {&#10;  await db.post.delete({ where: { id } });&#10;  revalidatePath(&#39;/posts&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/actions.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { db } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/lib/db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { revalidatePath } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">formData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'title'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formData.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.post.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ data: { title, content } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  revalidatePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deletePost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.post.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ where: { id } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  revalidatePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内联声明</strong>——在 Server Component 内部定义，可捕获闭包作用域：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app/posts/[id]/page.tsx (Server Component)&#10;import { db } from &#39;@/lib/db&#39;;&#10;import { revalidatePath } from &#39;next/cache&#39;;&#10;import { DeleteButton } from &#39;./DeleteButton&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default async function PostPage({ params }) {&#10;  const { id } = await params;&#10;  const post = await db.post.findUnique({ where: { id } });&#10;&#10;  async function deleteThisPost() {&#10;    &#39;use server&#39;;&#10;    await db.post.delete({ where: { id } }); // 捕获了 id&#10;    revalidatePath(&#39;/posts&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;article&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{post.title}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{post.content}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;DeleteButton action={deleteThisPost} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/article&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app/posts/[id]/page.tsx (Server Component)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { db } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@/lib/db'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { revalidatePath } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/cache'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { DeleteButton } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './DeleteButton'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> post</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.post.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findUnique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ where: { id } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteThisPost</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'use server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.post.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">delete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ where: { id } }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 捕获了 id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    revalidatePath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/posts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">article</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{post.title}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>{post.content}</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DeleteButton action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{deleteThisPost} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">article</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内联声明的优势在于闭包捕获：<code>id</code> 在服务端编译时被绑定到 Action 的加密引用中，客户端无法篡改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表单集成与渐进增强\">表单集成与渐进增强</h2><p>Server Actions 的设计目标之一是<strong>渐进增强</strong>（Progressive Enhancement）：即使 JavaScript 未加载或执行失败，表单仍然可以通过原生 HTML 表单提交工作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 渐进增强表单 — JS 禁用时仍可提交&#10;&#39;use client&#39;;&#10;import { useActionState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;import { createPost } from &#39;./actions&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function CreatePostForm() {&#10;  const [state, formAction, isPending] = useActionState(&#10;    createPost,&#10;    { error: null }&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;form action={formAction}&gt;&#10;      &lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required minLength={3} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;textarea name=&quot;content&quot; required /&gt;&#10;      {state?.error &amp;&amp; &lt;p className=&quot;error&quot;&gt;{state.error}&lt;/p&gt;}&#10;      &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; disabled={isPending}&gt;&#10;        {isPending ? &#39;提交中...&#39; : &#39;发布&#39;}&#10;      &lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/form&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 渐进增强表单 — JS 禁用时仍可提交</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'use client'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useActionState } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createPost } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './actions'</span><sp